    "body_text": "Skip to content Buy Rent House Prices Find Agent Commercial Inspire Overseas Sign in Sign in Buy Property for sale New homes for sale Property valuation Investors Mortgages Rent Property to rent Student property to rent Find Agent Find estate agents House prices Sold house prices Instant online valuation Commercial Commercial property to rent Commercial property for sale Advertise Inspire Moving stories Property news Energy efficiency Property guides Housing trends Overseas blog Mortgage guides Overseas All countries Spain France Portugal Italy Greece Currency Sell Overseas property See similar properties Click to open video Property photo 1 of 20. 1/201 Penton Road, Staines-upon-Thames, Surrey, TW18 £1,950 pcm £450 pw Tenancy info Added today Letting details Let available date: 23/05/2026 Deposit: £2,250 Furnish type: Unfurnished Council Tax: Ask agent PROPERTY TYPE Semi-Detached BEDROOMS 3 BATHROOMS 1 SIZE Ask agent 1 +14 Key features Three Bedroom Semi-Detached HouseOff Street ParkingGaragePrivate GardenClose to Town Centre and StationUnfurnishedSpelthorne Council Tax Band E Description VIDEO TOUR AVAILABLE - Situated on one of Staines-upon-Thames’ most sought-after roads, this delightful semi-detached home is close to the town centre, River Thames and mainline train station. The property features a large through lounge with bay window, fireplace and French doors leading to an orangery-style dining area open plan to fitted kitchen as well as entrance hall and downstairs WC. The first floor comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms and a large four-piece bathroom suite with sunken bath and separate walk-in shower. To the rear is an enclosed garden with courtyard area, raised lawned area and greenhouse whilst to the front there is off street parking as well as a shared driveway leading to a garage. Brochures Particulars Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: TBC PARKING Yes GARDEN Yes ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilit